{
  "_comment": "EST-1 (US-EST-1-04) — golden cases for estimate_job, run identically by estimateJob.test.ts and workflow_tests/32_estimate.xs (FT-EST-1-01). The epic's own sample JSON uses illustrative numbers ('133', a 'mixed' source) that are not independently pinned anywhere else in the PRD; this fixture was built by hand from the stated rules (PRD §6.2) so every number here is a real, checked hand calculation, not a copy of the epic's example. Where the numbers happen to coincide with the epic's s8 sample (baseline 10, variable 52, total 62) that is by design, not coincidence — see simpleOrder below.",

